model {
  extend basalt.deployment {
    metadata {
      constraint "EXECUTOR_TELEMETRY is secret text on every Worker that exports telemetry, and the runtime adapter refuses to roll a Worker back across a changed secret without force. Its version field stays the tools pin it carried when releases began to roll back, so a pin bump leaves the encoded secret byte for byte equal. The real version reaches the isolate in the plain EXECUTOR_TELEMETRY_VERSION binding, which the runtime prefers over the secret's field. Field names and order of the direct Sentry and Axiom secrets are fixed by test."
    }
  }
}
